Decision: reject without distributed timing.  Merely retaining the runtime
range branch changes the inner-loop schedule enough to lose 11-18% total,
even when every scale takes the synthesized side.  Arbitrary-scale support
must be resolved offline or at kernel granularity, not per dequantized word.
